{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 97, "line_no": 2, "text": "写为oi：除oi外，带韵尾的a 、0 是短元音，音质分别相当于［ -］、［ ］。", "bbox_px": {"x": 277, "y": 245, "w": 1154, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "写为oi：除oi外，带韵尾的a 、0 是短元音，音质分别相当于［ -］、［ ］。", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 277, "y": 245, "w": 1154, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 97, "line_no": 3, "text": "（3）辅音韵尾前的长元音i、u、e都带有近于［a］的流音，用a表示，即ia-、ua-、ea-，相当于", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 306, "w": 1459, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "（3）辅音韵尾前的长元音i、u、e都带有近于［a］的流音，用a表示，即ia-、ua-、ea-，相当于", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 306, "w": 1459, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 97, "line_no": 4, "text": "（4） ie、ue 的韵尾e，音质相当于［a］，但拼写现代汉语借词时，音质相当于［e］；ea 的音质是［ua］。", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 426, "w": 1451, "h": 45}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（4） ie、ue 的韵尾e，音质相当于［a］，但拼写现代汉语借词时，音质相当于［e］；ea 的音质是［ua］。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 426, "w": 1451, "h": 45}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 97, "line_no": 5, "text": "（5）塞音韵尾 b、 d、 g的音值分别为 b」、L 、一k，只闭塞不破裂。", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 487, "w": 1170, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "（5）塞音韵尾 b、 d、 g的音值分别为 b」、L 、一k，只闭塞不破裂。", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 487, "w": 1170, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
